  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Note, the editor CSS styles were recently moved into CSS global variables a few versions back. This release: 1) Better compliance with element nesting definitions to ensure quality source code; 2) replaced the context menus with floating toolbars that can be accessed by pressing Alt + O to make it more accessible to users; 3) custom color selectors in the color pickers.",
